{%- comment -%}
  ElmsNest «למי זה פחות מתאים» (P7) — the honest-guide differentiator.
  Sourced from product.metafields.custom.not_fit_for; rendered inside
  sections/elmsnest-product-guidance.liquid. Drops silently when empty.
  Styling lives in the guidance section's stylesheet (the section renders
  on both templates, elmsnest-pdp.css does not load on the old one).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign en_nf = product.metafields.custom.not_fit_for | metafield_text -%}
{%- if en_nf != blank -%}
<aside class="en-pdp-guide__notfit" dir="rtl">
  <h3>למי זה פחות מתאים</h3>
  <p>{{ en_nf | newline_to_br }}</p>
</aside>
{%- endif -%}
